 KHAAK PAR KAHOO DIL KA BEHRAHA THA SHIDDAT SE<br>
<br>
SHOWR-E-ALVIDA AKBAR UTH RAHA THA REH REH KAR,<br>
 KHAAK SAB UDATE THE PEET TE THE APNE SAR,<br>
